<section class="hero guide-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Get started</p>
  <h1>Self-hosting</h1>
  <p>
    Engrafo runs from one compose file on any machine with Docker and Docker
    Compose: a NAS, a home server, a small VPS. It is four containers from
    published images: Engrafo itself, Postgres, RustFS (the S3-compatible bucket
    your files live in) and a one-shot job that creates the buckets. Nothing to
    clone and nothing to build.
  </p>
</section>

